            <item>
                <title>Snap Closet Android Beta Is Now Open</title>
                <link>https://rikucherry1993.me/en/posts/2026-08-09snap-closet-android-beta/</link>
                <guid isPermaLink="true">https://rikucherry1993.me/en/posts/2026-08-09snap-closet-android-beta/</guid>
                <pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 19:12:00 &#43;0900</pubDate>
                
                    <author>rikucherry0522@gmail.com (rikucherry)</author>
                
                <copyright>[CC BY-NC-SA 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/deed.en)</copyright>
                
                    <description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This post was machine-translated from the Chinese original.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update (2026-08-20): This Android beta recruitment has ended. Thank you all for your enthusiastic participation! For future updates, please follow the blog and product page.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;  Long time no see! The blog has been quiet for a while, and this time I&#39;m back to share great news with you: &lt;strong&gt;Snap Closet&#39;s Android beta is now open!&lt;/strong&gt; The iOS version is coming soon to the App Store, while the Android version is launching first through beta testing. If you&#39;re an Android user and want to experience it first, feel free to sign up for the beta using the steps below.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;center&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://rikucherry1993.me/images/20260809/android-beta-steps.png&#34; style=&#34;zoom:50%&#34;/&gt;&lt;/center&gt;
&lt;p&gt;  The participation steps from the image are organized in text below:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;android-beta-participation-steps&#34;&gt;Android Beta Participation Steps&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visit the Snap Closet product page: &lt;a href=&#34;https://snap-closet.com/&#34;&gt;https://snap-closet.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Click the &amp;quot;Android Beta Entry&amp;quot; button next to the title, fill out the form to participate (the form contains specific rules and exclusive beta benefits information).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Limited spots available, first come first served.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;  Looking forward to your participation and feedback!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note: This beta is only available to Android users who can access and download apps from the Google Play Store.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
</description>
                
                
                
                
                
                    
                        
                            
                                
                                
                                
